    "api_endpoints": "- POST /api/v1/auth/aadhaar-kyc\n- POST /api/v1/auth/otp-verify\n- GET /api/v1/smartcity/dashboard\n- POST /api/v1/smartcity/analyze\n- GET /api/v1/schemes?category=&state=\n- POST /api/v1/ai/query (multilingual RAG)\n- POST /api/v1/grievances\n- GET /api/v1/grievances/status\n- GET /api/v1/analytics/impact\n- POST /api/v1/reports/generate\n- GET /api/v1/government-api/sync\n- POST /api/v1/offline/sync\n- GET /api/v1/language/translate\n- POST /api/v1/notifications/send\n- WS /ws/live-updates",
    "win_secret": "<b>SIH Judge Psychology:</b> SIH judges are ministry officials and domain experts. They want to see: (1) Direct relevance to the ministry's specific mandate, (2) India-specific context (not a generic global solution), (3) Working prototype — not slides. A live demo beats everything else.<br><b>Demo Hook (0-30s):</b> Show the primary feature solving the exact stated problem with real/realistic Indian data. For SIH1736: demonstrate the core AI functionality with a live example that addresses \"AI-Powered Automatic Railway Track Defect Detection System\".<br><b>SIH-Specific Tips:</b> Use government data (data.gov.in), mention integration with ministry portals, show offline capability (rural India), support Hindi + regional language. Previous winners always had a working demo + clear impact metric.<br><b>Market Impact:</b> \"This solution directly addresses a mandate of Indian Railways / Ministry of Railways, serving millions of beneficiaries. Implementation cost <₹10L with government cloud. Scales to national deployment via NIC.\"<br><b>Q&A Prep:</b> Know the ministry's flagship schemes, data.gov.in APIs, NIC cloud infrastructure, DigiLocker/ABHA/UIDAI integration, and NDSP framework.",
