    "win_secret": "<b>Imagine Cup Judge Psychology:</b> Microsoft judges look for: social impact measurability, creative use of Azure AI services (not just GPT-4 wrapper), working demo, and global scalability story.<br><b>Demo Hook (0-30s):</b> Show the AI feature working live — the moment it solves the problem visually. For Hollo: AI Mental Health Support Companion: demonstrate the core transformation (input → AI → improved outcome).<br><b>Azure Bonus Points:</b> Use Azure Responsible AI dashboard, Azure AI Safety evaluations, and Azure Monitor for observability.<br><b>Market Stat:</b> Quote the population affected by this problem and the economic cost. \"Hollo from Hong Kong SAR proved that student teams can build world-class AI solutions that reach millions.\"<br><b>Q&A Prep:</b> Know Azure AI service pricing, Microsoft Responsible AI principles, data privacy (GDPR/CCPA), and how Azure Marketplace deployment would work.",
