    "win_secret": "<b>Judge Psychology (Google Solution Challenge 2024):</b> These judges are industry experts evaluating thousands of submissions. They make first impressions in 30 seconds — your demo hook must be visual, fast, and WOW.<br><b>Demo Hook:</b> \"NeuThera: AI Drug Discovery Toolkit with Molecular Design\" — show the AI solving the exact problem in real time, live, no loading spinners.<br><b>Sponsor Tip:</b> Maximize use of Google (for GDSC/GDG) specific tools — judges from Google (for GDSC/GDG) reward deep platform integration.<br><b>Competition Strategy:</b> Previous winners: working demo + clear impact metric + story. No slides during live demo. Know the exact judging criteria and address each criterion explicitly in your pitch.<br><b>Q&A Prep:</b> Scalability plan, data privacy, monetization, and what makes this different from existing solutions.",
