    "mega_prompt": "You are building a hackathon project for: \"Enterprise LLM + RAG for Decision Intelligence\" from ATMECS Global GenAI Hackathon 2024. Problem: Enterprise AI challenge: Build LLM + RAG systems redefining enterprise decision-making. Use cases: automated report generation, intelligent document search, anomaly detection in business processes, and AI-driven strategic recommendations from structured/unstructured data. Build with Next.js 14 + FastAPI + PostgreSQL + GPT-4o. Requirements: (1) Working AI feature in first 8 hours. (2) Use ATMECS specific APIs/SDKs for bonus points. (3) Mobile-responsive UI with smooth demo flow. (4) Quantify impact: show the metric the judges care about. (5) 2-minute demo script: hook → problem → live AI demo → impact metric → call to action. Deploy on Vercel + Railway. Prioritize demo quality over feature completeness.",
    "database_schema": "Table users { id uuid [pk], email varchar, created_at timestamp }\nTable aitools_data { id uuid [pk], user_id uuid, input jsonb, ai_output text, score float, created_at timestamp }\nTable demo_sessions { id uuid [pk], demo_type varchar, inputs jsonb, outputs jsonb, latency_ms int, timestamp timestamp }\nTable impact_log { id uuid [pk], metric_name varchar, value float, unit varchar, timestamp timestamp }\nTable feedback { id uuid [pk], user_id uuid, rating int, comment text, timestamp timestamp }",
