    "techstack": "<h4>Frontend:</h4> Next.js 14 + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui.<br><h4>Backend:</h4> FastAPI (Python) + async processing.<br><h4>Database:</h4> PostgreSQL + Redis + vector store (Pinecone/Chroma).<br><h4>Auth:</h4> Clerk or sponsor platform auth.<br><h4>AI:</h4> GPT-4o + domain-specific models + sponsor AI APIs.<br><h4>Deploy:</h4> Vercel + Railway OR sponsor cloud (AWS/GCP/Azure).",
