    "mega_prompt": "You are building a hackathon project for: \"Smart Campus Accessibility Navigator\" from PennApps XXV 2024. Problem: PennApps 36-hour hackathon. AI-powered campus navigation for students with mobility impairments and accessibility needs. Real-time elevator status, accessible route mapping, crowd density prediction, and personalized campus wayfinding. Build with Next.js 14 + FastAPI + PostgreSQL + GPT-4o. Requirements: (1) Working AI feature in first 8 hours. (2) Use University of Pennsylvania specific APIs/SDKs for bonus points. (3) Mobile-responsive UI with smooth demo flow. (4) Quantify impact: show the metric the judges care about. (5) 2-minute demo script: hook → problem → live AI demo → impact metric → call to action. Deploy on Vercel + Railway. Prioritize demo quality over feature completeness.",
